+/*
+ * Master switch for the network privacy enhancements.  Writing a new
+ * value updates all of the individual switches at once so they cannot
+ * be left in an inconsistent state by a partially applied sysctl.
+ *
+ * Reading the sysctl returns the value of the cloned route switch.
